# Enterprise-Network-Design-using-OSPF in Cisco Packet Tracer

## Project Report

**Project Title:** Enterprise-Network-Design-using-OSPF in Cisco Packet Tracer

**Developed By:** Sowjanya Peeka

**Simulation Platform:** Cisco Packet Tracer

**Routing Protocol:** OSPF (Area 0)

