# 3. Network Topology

The network consists of the following devices:

- Internet Router
- ISP Router
- Company Edge Router
- Core Router
- Branch Router
- HR Access Switch
- Branch Switch
- DHCP Server
- HR PCs
- Branch PCs
- Trainee Laptops

Internal routing is handled using OSPF, while Internet connectivity is provided through the Edge Router.

